From: Specula <noreply@specula.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] Fix NB-5: fulfill snapshot promise on leadership change

SnapshotManager::sendSnapshot() creates a promise at line 33, but the
leadership check at lines 42-46 returns early without fulfilling it.
This destroys the promise, causing a BrokenPromise exception on the
future side.  The Host's thenValue callback never fires, leaving
sendingSnapshot_=true permanently — the Host can never send logs or
snapshots to this peer again.

Fix: call p.setValue(Status::Error(...)) before the early return.

Also add .thenError() in Host::startSendSnapshot() as defense-in-depth,
so sendingSnapshot_ is always cleared regardless of exception type.

Bug: vesoft-inc/nebula#63
---
 src/kvstore/raftex/Host.cpp            | 5 +++++
 src/kvstore/raftex/SnapshotManager.cpp | 1 +
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/kvstore/raftex/SnapshotManager.cpp b/src/kvstore/raftex/SnapshotManager.cpp
index abcdef1..1234567 100644
--- a/src/kvstore/raftex/SnapshotManager.cpp
+++ b/src/kvstore/raftex/SnapshotManager.cpp
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@ folly::Future<StatusOr<std::pair<LogID, TermID>>> SnapshotManager::sendSnapshot(
     if (tr.second != RaftPart::Role::LEADER) {
       VLOG(1) << part->idStr_ << "leader changed, term " << tr.first
               << ", do not send snapshot to " << dst;
+      p.setValue(Status::Error("Leadership changed"));
       return;
     }
     auto termId = tr.first;
diff --git a/src/kvstore/raftex/Host.cpp b/src/kvstore/raftex/Host.cpp
index abcdef2..1234568 100644
--- a/src/kvstore/raftex/Host.cpp
+++ b/src/kvstore/raftex/Host.cpp
@@ -371,6 +371,11 @@ nebula::cpp2::ErrorCode Host::startSendSnapshot() {
           self->sendingSnapshot_ = false;
           self->noMoreRequestCV_.notify_all();
+        })
+        .thenError(folly::tag_t<std::exception>{}, [self = shared_from_this()](std::exception&& e) {
+          LOG(ERROR) << self->idStr_ << "Snapshot future error: " << e.what();
+          std::lock_guard<std::mutex> g(self->lock_);
+          self->sendingSnapshot_ = false;
+          self->noMoreRequestCV_.notify_all();
         });
   } else {
     VLOG_EVERY_N(2, 1000) << idStr_ << "The snapshot req is in queue, please wait for a moment";
